Description: StatLens provides a focused toolkit for exploratory data analysis
    (EDA) in R. It includes functions for descriptive statistics, outlier
    detection, missing-data profiling, correlation analysis, and distribution
    visualization. The package implements both S3 and S4 object systems to
    represent analysis results in a structured and extensible way, making it
    easy to integrate into reproducible research workflows.
